    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pēro</span></b> , ōnis,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a kind of boot made of raw hide</i>, worn chiefly by soldiers
			and wagoners (cf. caliga): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crudus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 690</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alto per glaciem perone tegi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					14, 186</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 465</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 4, 20</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perones effeminati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Pall. 5</span></i>
			.</div>
